07	Display.Conversation	Ferryman	Northport, is it? Step aboard when a boat's in, and pay a coin. They leave both piers on the bell and pass in the strait.\Nobody's lost a passenger in years. Well. Nobody's lost one this year.	Thanks, Wim.	25
