12	Display.Conversation	Ferryman	Papers? Let's have a look, then.\He unfolds them, and stops at the seal, and looks at you for a long while.\Well. That's not my business, and I'll not make it mine. Those'll get you past any guard in Northport.\And when you land: there's a shardstone by the market. Feed it a few Shards and it wakes, and after that it'll carry you to any other shardstone you've woken. Mind your Shards.	Thank you, Wim.	13
